WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.743
Bada is very untidy.

2
00:00:09.744 --> 00:00:14.951
Just look at his room and you'll know what I mean.

3
00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:17.172
Mom: Oh my goodness!

4
00:00:17.173 --> 00:00:19.309
There's water everywhere.

5
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.553
Hana, Bada, come over here.

6
00:00:22.554 --> 00:00:24.823
Hana: Mom, what's wrong?

7
00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:28.100
Bada: Yeah, Mom. I'm here.

8
00:00:28.101 --> 00:00:30.438
Mom: Who spilled the water here?

9
00:00:30.439 --> 00:00:32.551
Hana: Not me!

10
00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:34.374
Bada: Uh . . .

11
00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:37.997
Mom: Bada, were you playing with water?

12
00:00:37.998 --> 00:00:41.921
Bada: Uh, I was not playing.

13
00:00:41.922 --> 00:00:46.739
Actually I was going to water the plants.

14
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.154
Mom: I see. But look!

15
00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:50.749
The floor is slippery.

16
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.897
Someone could get hurt.

17
00:00:52.898 --> 00:00:56.199
Bada: Sorry, Mom. I will wipe it up.

18
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.421
Mom: Thank you, dear.

19
00:00:59.422 --> 00:01:01.583
Here is a mop.

20
00:01:01.584 --> 00:01:04.666
Bada: Hana, will you help me?

21
00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:08.920
Hana: Are you kidding? No way!

22
00:01:08.921 --> 00:01:13.889
Sorry, Bada. Mopping is your job!
